    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in a great location in Ratoath, this spacious three-bedroom apartment offers a versatile layout arranged over two floors. With three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a spacious balcony and a communal green to the front, the property provides a wonderful combination of space, comfort and convenience.\n\nThe first floor features a bright open-plan kitchen and living area. Its generous U-shaped layout makes excellent use of the space, creating a practical yet welcoming setting with plenty of room for cooking and everyday living. The kitchen flows seamlessly into a spacious living room, creating a generous open-plan space, with direct access from the living area onto the balcony. The balcony provides a lovely private outdoor space with plenty of room to sit and relax.\n\nThis level also offers two generously sized bedrooms, providing bright and comfortable accommodation with plenty of space to unwind. Two bathrooms add to the practicality of the layout, making the apartment particularly well suited to family living, guests or those looking for flexible bedroom space.\n\nOne of the most appealing features of the property is the accommodation on the upper floor. Here, a third bedroom is complemented by its own separate living room, creating a particularly flexible area within the apartment. This could work extremely well as a private suite for an older child, guests or anyone looking for their own living space within the home. Alternatively, the additional reception room could make an excellent home office, TV room or relaxation space.\n\nConveniently located in Ratoath, with an excellent range of shops, cafés, schools and everyday amenities close at hand, the property enjoys all the convenience of village living while offering an exceptional amount of space. \n\nWith three bedrooms, two bathrooms, two separate living areas and accommodation arranged over two floors, this is a home that offers far more than you might expect from apartment living. Spacious, versatile and superbly located, it is a property that really needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nSome images may have been digitally enhanced or virtually staged to illustrate the property's potential. All measurements and floor areas are approximate and have been given in good faith. Prospective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details and measurements through their own inspection.\n\nSummary of the apartment: -\n3 bed | 2 bath\nBuilt in 2002\n116.96 sqm\nManagement Fees: 1,750\nExcellent location\nSpacious two-storey apartment\nBright and spacious kitchen / living area\nSeparate second living room\nUnique upstairs bedroom with its own living space\nSpacious private balcony\nCommunal green to the front\n\n"
      },
